racy. Tiny tiles lose dispatch overhead;256and512sometimes faster, but no retained complete official result.\n- **570–575 marginal dispatch:** replace row/column sums by GEMM/BMM against two-dimensional ones columns. All30pass. Point-column571 looked faster in fresh diagnostics but actual official0.03716657 lost to5650.03685866. Class BMM reductions were slower locally.\n- **576–584 direct/combined point and class blocking:** tile guarded first unshifted residual exponentials, combine with recurrence tiles, or process10/20/50class pairs per block. All30pass. Class20pair blocking plus point-GEMMcolumns591 had fresh advantages but official0.03818366 lost.\n- **585–587 cost addmm and allocation lifetime controls:** label matrix serves as GEMM bias/output before/after norms, or is explicitly bound as a temporary. All30pass; fresh timing does not support retaining addmm variants.\n- **588–590 coupling accuracy-budget controls:** half/full quadratic reciprocal correction and exact second column reciprocal. All30pass but worst nRMSE increases to0.0071915/0.0074416/0.0073406 from base0.0070258, so no extra accuracy budget established.\n- **591–600 layout/combination/exponential controls:** complementary class blocking and point GEMM, actual physical column-major point kernels, exp versus exp2. Seven pass;595–597 have generated fallback indentation errors, all30import-failure records preserved. Corrected609–611 pass but are slower, means0.046–0.052.\n- **601–613 scaling fusion and buffer reuse:** Torch einsum/outer-scaling and final point power tiles pass. Point/all residual buffer sources604/606 have the same generated indentation error; corrected612/613 compile and pass all30. Class605 and both613 buffer reuse sometimes improve diagnostic timing. Original failures/builders stay unchanged.\n- **614–621 exact cost factorization:** point22dimensional augmented GEMM, label-first reduction order, feature-only12dimensional control, zero padding32, plus point-column GEMM. Class12dimensional homogeneous BMM and combinations also pass all30. Fresh timings favored class-and-point combination620; it received complete official evaluation.\n- **622–624 exact lifted nearest-neighbor trees:** complete reference c-transform computed per reference class in11dimensions, with zero approximate-query tolerance and all reference supports. All30pass but means0.0559–0.0586 are slower. Reject for speed. Mathematical derivation archived.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
